{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[{"->":"start"},"\n","\n",["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":["ev","str","^intro","/str",{"x()":"play_music","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","^I've recently become intersted in learning Japanese ever since I've grown closer to my friend ","ev",{"VAR?":"FriendName"},"out","/ev","^. ","#","^id:3a","/#","\n","^We met at a young age when her family moved from Japan to my neighborhood in the US. ","#","^id:3b","/#","\n","^We didn't get along at first. ","#","^id:3c","/#","\n","^Her assertive attitude and excess confidence in herself rubbed me the wrong way. ","#","^id:3d","/#","\n","^But as time passed by, and we grew older, we got used to one another, and became friends. ","#","^id:3e","/#","\n","^Now we're both 20-year-old college students, and we've become best friends to each other! ","#","^id:3f","/#","\n","^I played a big role in her English learning journey, yet I never tried to learn Japanese seriously... ","#","^id:40","/#","\n","^Until now. ","#","^id:41","/#","\n","^friend: ","ev",{"VAR?":"PlayerName"},"out","/ev","^! I found an exchange program that goes to Japan! We should do it together! ","#","^id:42","/#","\n","#","^friend: ","ev",{"VAR?":"PlayerName"},"out","/ev","^！ 日本に行ける交換留学プログラム見つけたの！ 一緒に行こうよ！","/#","ev",{"VAR?":"FriendName"},"out","/ev","^ texted me late one night... ","#","^id:43","/#","\n","#","^ある日の夜遅く、","ev",{"VAR?":"FriendName"},"out","/ev","^からそんなメッセージが届いた……。","/#","^I immediately agreed! ","#","^id:44","/#","\n","#","^俺は二つ返事でOKと返した。","/#","^[wait time=\"1.0\" skippable=\"true\"]","\n","^And so, my journey to learn Japanese... it's finally starting. ","#","^id:45","/#","\n","#","^こうして、俺の日本語学習の旅が……ついに始まる。","/#","^For real this time! ","#","^id:46","/#","\n","#","^今度こそ、本当に！","/#","#","/#","#","^do Dialogue.set_next_scene(\"website1\")","/#","^[wait time=\"0.1\" skippable=\"true\"]","\n",{"->":"start2"},null],"start2":["ev","str","^intro","/str",{"x()":"background","exArgs":1},"pop","/ev","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"FriendName"},"out","/ev","^ and I walk together through the hallways, getting used to our surroundings. ","#","^id:47","/#","\n","^Even though we've been here for a few weeks already, it still feels so different from back home. ","#","^id:48","/#","\n","#","^MISSING TRANSLATION","/#","ev","str","^Aoi","/str",true,{"x()":"show_or_hide","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","^friend (Smile): ","ev",{"VAR?":"PlayerName"},"out","/ev","^, look a Japanese fashion club! ","#","^id:49","/#","\n","#","^MISSING TRANSLATION","/#","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^Neutral","/str",{"x()":"change_expression","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","^main_character: Japanese fashion club? ","#","^id:4a","/#","\n","#","^MISSING TRANSLATION","/#","^friend (Neutral): Yeah! It says here it's newly formed and they're looking for members. ","#","^id:4b","/#","\n","#","^MISSING TRANSLATION","/#","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^Smile","/str",{"x()":"change_expression","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","^friend (Smile): Let's join! ","#","^id:4c","/#","\n","#","^MISSING TRANSLATION","/#","^main_character: I don't know... I'm not into Japanese fashion like you are. ","#","^id:4d","/#","\n","#","^MISSING TRANSLATION","/#","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^Happy","/str",{"x()":"change_expression","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","^friend (Neutral): Come on, it's gonna be fun! ","#","^id:4e","/#","\n","#","^friend (JoySPeaking): ねえ、絶対楽しいって！","/#","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^Neutral","/str",{"x()":"change_expression","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","^main_character: But I'm not interested in your fashion kei whatever, ","ev",{"VAR?":"FriendName"},"out","/ev","^! ","#","^id:4f","/#","\n","#","^main_character: でも俺、お前の言う「おしゃれ」だか何だかにはあんまり興味ないんだって","ev",{"VAR?":"FriendName"},"out","/ev","^！","/#","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^Happy","/str",{"x()":"change_expression","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","^friend (Happy): But you'd be so... ","#","^id:50","/#","\n","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^Smile","/str",{"x()":"change_expression","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^kawaii","/str",{"x()":"speak","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","^friend (Smile): Kawaii! ","#","^id:51","/#","\n","^main_character: Yeah, but it's not something I'm going to wear. ","#","^id:52","/#","\n","^update friend (Neutral)","\n","#","^main_character: いや、服がかわいくても俺が着るわけじゃないだろ。","/#","^main_character: Are there even fashion trends for men? ","#","^id:53","/#","\n","#","^main_character: そもそも男向けにも、そういうファッションの流行ってあるの？","/#","^friend (Confused): ","ev",{"VAR?":"PlayerName"},"out","/ev","^ you've asked me that before, of course there are! ","#","^id:54","/#","\n","#","^friend (NeutralSpeaking): ","ev",{"VAR?":"PlayerName"},"out","/ev","^、それ前にも聞いてたよ？ もちろんあるよ！","/#","^main_character: Ugh… I don't want to… ","#","^id:55","/#","\n","#","^main_character: んー……やっぱ行きたくない……。","/#","^friend (Happy): Don't you want to learn more japanese? You can meet Japanese people in here! ","#","^id:56","/#","\n","#","^friend (JoySPeaking): 日本語、もっと覚えたいんでしょ？ ここなら日本人とも知り合えるよ！","/#","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^kanojo","/str",{"x()":"speak","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","^friend (Mischievous): かのじょ も みつかる かも~ ","#","^id:57","/#","\n","#","^MISSING TRANSLATION","/#","^main_character: A... what? ","#","^id:5a","/#","\n","#","^MISSING TRANSLATION","/#","^friend (Happy): You know, a かのじょ? You've probably heard that word before... ","#","^id:5b","/#","\n","#","^MISSING TRANSLATION","/#","^update friend (Neutral)","\n","^main_character: Maybe, I don't remember it though. ","#","^id:5c","/#","\n","#","^MISSING TRANSLATION","/#","^friend (Smug): Then let me spell it out for you. At this club, you can find a... ","#","^id:5d","/#","\n","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^Mischevious","/str",{"x()":"change_expression","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^zoom_in","/str",{"x()":"animate","exArgs":2},"pop","/ev","\n","^friend (Smug): [b]G[/b]","\n","ev","str","^Aoi","/str","str","^pulse","/str",{"x()":"animate","exArgs":2},"p